    (Q⁻¹ * Matrix.single a b 1 * Q) * (Q⁻¹ * Matrix.single c d 1 * Q) -
      (Q⁻¹ * Matrix.single c d 1 * Q) * (Q⁻¹ * Matrix.single a b 1 * Q) =
